<title>LATVIA: NARUTA FIRST QUARTER PROFIT 2,730 LATS.</title>
<headline>NARUTA FIRST QUARTER PROFIT 2,730 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first quarter profit of Latvian confectionary company Naruta was 2,730 lats after turnover of 139,550 lats, the stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock exchange did not give comparative figures for the company but said it made a gross profit of 14,465 lats, had production costs of 7,976 lats and administrative costs of 1,947 lats.</p>
<p>The profit before extraordinary items and tax was 4,653 lats, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
